    "finalText": "The implementation is complete and fully verified. Final state:\n\n**Files created/changed:**\n- `database/migrations/2026_11_22_000000_create_links_table.php` — `links` table (unique `code`, `url`, `clicks` default 0)\n- `app/Models/Link.php` — Eloquent model with integer `clicks` cast\n- `app/Http/Controllers/LinkController.php` — store/show/visit/index with exact status codes and JSON shapes\n- `routes/api.php` + `bootstrap/app.php` — routes registered with `apiPrefix: ''`, plus exception renderers mapping validation errors → 422 `{\"error\"}` and router 404s → 404 `{\"error\"}`\n- `start.sh` (executable) — `php artisan migrate --force` then `php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload`\n- `README.md` — \"Starting the Server\" section\n\n**Verified end-to-end:** 201 creates (custom + generated code matching `[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}`), 409 duplicates, 200 show/list in ascending order, 302 with exact Location and exactly-one click increment, 404s with `error`, 422 for malformed JSON/missing url/invalid urls/invalid codes, persistence across a server restart (clicks survived), DB settings read from environment, empty-state list `{\"items\":[],\"total\":0}`, and the existing test suite passes. The table was cleared of my test rows and port 8000 is free for `sh start.sh`."
